OL,5,     FShow
OL,6,     GPutting down the Trunk of Funk is
OL,7,     GDiogo Strausz, a seriously
OL,8,     Gtalented Brazilian producer whose
OL,9,     Glatest record nods to the
OL,10,     Gtrailblazing 80s Brazilian sound.
